Component Plan

For my component that I have started and got a decent amount of progress on, I wanted to add a rating system to my gallery page, as I thought it would be a fun feature for people to be able to rate the photos 1-5 to see which ones are liked more than others, and I used flexbox  to place them into the gallery. I am also experimenting with the size/color transition when you hover or select on the stars, and am trying to figure out currently how to make it select all of the stars to the left of the one that you select. 
